1
00:00:00,341 --> 00:00:02,711
(Amy:)Try and get that nag
off your back, right?

2
00:00:04,011 --> 00:00:05,341
I mean, you're not a bicycle;

3
00:00:05,346 --> 00:00:07,976
(Amy:)why's she riding you like that?

4
00:00:07,982 --> 00:00:10,082
(Penny:)No, I think she was
just trying to help.

5
00:00:10,084 --> 00:00:12,814
(Penny:)Plus, I really want to do well
at this job. So...

6
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,420
(Amy:)Okay, good luck.
And call me later,

7
00:00:14,422 --> 00:00:17,152
(Amy:)you know, if you decide
she's a bitch or something.

8
00:00:22,396 --> 00:00:24,496
(Amy(on phone):)Hey, girlfriend.

9
00:00:24,498 --> 00:00:25,928
(Bernadette:)Hey, Amy.

10
00:00:25,933 --> 00:00:27,433
(Amy:)Tonight. You, me, Color Me Mine.

11
00:00:27,435 --> 00:00:31,535
(Amy:)Maybe we sneak in some pinot--
make it Color Me Wine.

12
00:00:31,539 --> 00:00:33,739
(Bernadette:)That sounds fun,
but I promised Penny

13
00:00:33,741 --> 00:00:35,211
(Bernadette:)I'd come by and help her study.

14
00:00:35,209 --> 00:00:38,009
(Amy:)Oh. Well, good luck
getting her to do that.

15
00:00:38,012 --> 00:00:40,612
(Amy:)She's probably off
getting another manicure.

16
00:00:40,614 --> 00:00:42,314
(Amy:)You remember when she did that?

17
00:00:42,316 --> 00:00:44,686
(Amy:)You remember?

18
00:00:44,685 --> 00:00:46,885
(Bernadette:)I was probably being
too hard on her.

19
00:00:46,887 --> 00:00:48,217
(Bernadette:)We talked, we're good.

20
00:00:48,222 --> 00:00:49,792
(Amy:)Oh. Great.

21
00:00:49,790 --> 00:00:51,390
(Amy:)I'm happy for you guys.

22
00:00:51,392 --> 00:00:53,192
(Amy:)You know, when the two of you
aren't getting along,

23
00:00:53,194 --> 00:00:56,194
(Amy:)it puts me in a really
weird position.

24
00:00:56,197 --> 00:00:58,397
(Bernadette:)Well, don't worry--
everything's back to normal.

25
00:00:58,399 --> 00:01:05,029
(Amy:)You mean, like, where she's nice
to your face? Okay got it. Bye.

